<title>SPAIN: Spain's Meff says to raise Ibex futures nominal.</title>
<headline>Spain's Meff says to raise Ibex futures nominal.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Meff said on Wednesday its board approved raising the nominal value of the IBEX-35 contracts to 4.3 million pesetas from the current 430,000 by substituting a new contract for the old on January 20, 1997.</p>
</text>
